#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"Each level is a pixel drawing made of bricks. Once the level is cleared, you"
" level up and choose one or more upgrades, and play the next level."
msgid "Level"
msgstr "நிலை"

#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"This number is show on the paddle. It is the number of coins that appear for"
" each brick broken. It can increase but also reset to its base value, the "
"base combo."
msgid "Combo"
msgstr "சேர்க்கை"

#, terminology
msgctxt "The upgardes are picked after each level and mutate the gameplay."
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "மேம்படுத்தல்"

#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"The coins are dropped by the bricks. You need to catch them with the paddle "
"to gain score."
msgid "Coin"
msgstr "நாணயம்"

#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"The bricks are destroyed using the ball. They release coins when they break."
msgid "Brick"
msgstr "செங்கல்"

#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"The balls bounce on the sides, on the paddle, and on the brick. They break "
"the bricks they touch."
msgid "Ball"
msgstr "பந்து"

#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"The score is shown on the top right of the screen. It is the number of coins"
" you have cought since the game started."
msgid "Score"
msgstr "கெலிப்பெண்"

#, terminology
msgctxt ""
"The paddle is the white bar at the bottom of the screen, that the user can "
"move around using his finger, mouse or keyboard."
msgid "Paddle"
msgstr "துடுப்பு"
